{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "94158305-b841-4831-b17a-cf52a92948c5",
    "name": "Facility Service - Mobile Number Change Request",
    "description": "Registered mobile number change request APIs (SEM 4.0, issue #3209).\n\nHappy path: User > Create request, then CRM > Search approval queue, then CRM > Approve or Reject (or User > Cancel).\n\nRequestInfo.userInfo is hard-coded with roles so the collection works when calling the service directly (port-forward). Through the gateway, the auth token is what counts: set `facilityUserAuthToken` / `crmAuthToken` to real tokens.\n\nEvery body carries a `tenantId` outside RequestInfo: the API gateway rejects requests without one (\"Failed to parse request at API gateway\").",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Facility user",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"RequestInfo\": {\n    \"apiId\": \"Rainmaker\",\n    \"ver\": \"1.0\",\n    \"ts\": 0,\n    \"action\": \"create\",\n    \"msgId\": \"{{$timestamp}}|en_IN\",\n    \"authToken\": \"{{facilityUserAuthToken}}\",\n    \"userInfo\": {\n      \"uuid\": \"{{facilityUserUuid}}\",\n      \"type\": \"EMPLOYEE\",\n      \"userName\": \"{{facilityUserName}}\",\n      \"tenantId\": \"{{tenantId}}\",\n      \"roles\": [\n        {\n          \"code\": \"COMPLAINANT\",\n          \"name\": \"Complainant\",\n          \"tenantId\": \"{{tenantId}}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"code\": \"EMPLOYEE\",\n          \"name\": \"Employee\",\n          \"tenantId\": \"{{tenantId}}\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"MobileChangeRequest\": {\n    \"tenantId\": \"{{tenantId}}\",\n    \"newMobileNumber\": \"{{newMobileNumber}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/facility-service/v2/facility/mobile-change-request/_create",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "facility-service",
                "v2",
                "facility",
                "mobile-change-request",
                "_create"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Facility user raises a change request. The user, facility and current number come from the logged-in user's HRMS record; only `newMobileNumber` is read. Saves the new id into `{{requestId}}`."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (r.MobileChangeRequests && r.MobileChangeRequests.length) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('requestId', r.MobileChangeRequests[0].id);",
                  "  pm.test('request is PENDING', () => pm.expect(r.MobileChangeRequests[0].status).to.eql('PENDING'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Search my requests",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
